Description: Keep magnet webseeds in the synthetic .torrent
 build_metainfo_except_info_dict() filled a url-list vector but never added
 it to the top-level dict, so webseeds from a magnet link's ws= parameter
 were lost once its metadata finished downloading: missing from the saved
 .torrent and from the torrent's webseed list. Regressed in 55da783e8
 (4.1.0). Adds TorrentMagnetTest.setMetadataPieceKeepsWebseeds.
 .
 The test hunk is rebased onto Debian's use-system-libs.patch, which moves
 the gtest include; the library change is the upstream commit unchanged.
Author: netravnen <1938389+netravnen@users.noreply.github.com>
Origin: other, https://github.com/netravnen/transmission/commit/d99fbd044fe6c5ac85f845b4e44bf728eeffcda9
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-18
